tSim.Components.LowRateTelemetryTransmitterUnit</a></td><td>低速遥测基带组件</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"modelica://OneSatSim.Components.MEMSIMUUnit\">OneSatSim.Components.MEMSIMUUnit</a></td><td>MEMS惯性测量组件</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"modelica://OneSatSim.Components.MagnetometerUnit\">OneSatSim.Components.MagnetometerUnit</a></td><td>三轴磁强计组件</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"modelica://OneSatSim.Components.MagnetorquerUnit\">OneSatSim.Components.MagnetorquerUnit</a></td><td>三轴磁力矩器组件</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"modelica://OneSatSim.Components.MissionControlUnit\">OneSatSim.Components.MissionControlUnit</a></td><td>星务任务与指令控制组件</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"modelica://OneSatSim.Components.NaviEnhancePayloadUnit\">OneSatSim.Components.NaviEnhancePayloadUnit</a></td><td>导航增强载荷组件</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"modelica://OneSatSim.Components.OnboardComputerUnit\">OneSatSim.Components.OnboardComputerUnit</a></td><td>星务计算机与遥测处理组件</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"modelica://OneSatSim.Components.PowerConditioningUnit\">OneSatSim.Components.PowerConditioningUnit</a></td><td>电源调节与配电组件</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"modelica://OneSatSim.Components.RadioReceiverUnit\">OneSatSim.Components.RadioReceiverUnit</a></td><td>测控接收机组件</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"modelica://OneSatSim.Components.RateGyroUnit\">OneSatSim.Components.RateGyroUnit</a></td><td>三轴角速率陀螺组件</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"modelica://OneSatSim.Components.ReactionWheelSUnit\">OneSatSim.Components.ReactionWheelSUnit</a></td><td>斜置反作用飞轮组件</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"modelica://OneSatSim.Components.ReactionWheelXUnit\">OneSatSim.Components.ReactionWheelXUnit</a></td><td>X轴反作用飞轮组件</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"modelica://OneSatSim.Components.ReactionWheelYUnit\">OneSatSim.Components.ReactionWheelYUnit</a></td><td>Y轴反作用飞轮组件</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"modelica://OneSatSim.Components.ReactionWheelZUnit\">OneSatSim.Components.ReactionWheelZUnit</a></td><td>Z轴反作用飞轮组件</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"modelica://OneSatSim.Components.SelfieCameraUnit\">OneSatSim.Components.Selfie